# Generated documentation-site content. `scripts/build-site-content.ts` derives every page
# below from the canonical Markdown elsewhere in this repository (plugins/, docs/, openspec/,
# and the root governance files). The sources are tracked; these copies are not, so tracked
# bytes stay flat as the catalog grows. CI regenerates them before `bun run build`; run
# `node scripts/build-site-content.ts` locally before `bun run dev`.
